## License and Terms of Use
Access to this dataset is granted under the **Precision Aging® Network Data Use Agreement (DUA)**. By downloading or using this data, you agree to the following core terms:

* **Non-Commercial Use:** Data must be used for non-profit or academic pursuits only. 
* **No Redistribution:** You may not redistribute individual participant-level data.
* **Non-Identification:** You will not attempt to establish the identity of any PAN participants.
* **Mandatory Citation:** Specific citation of the PAN funding source (NIA 5U19AG065169) and the "Precision Aging Network" authorship writing block is required for all publications.

**The full legal text of the DUA is located in the LICENSE file in the root directory.**

